Variable Default Description <code>GATEWAY_AWS_ENABLED</code> <code>false</code> Set to <code>true</code> to enable the AWS adapter. <code>GATEWAY_AWS_REGION</code> <code>us-east-1</code> AWS region to query. <code>GATEWAY_AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID</code> — AWS access key ID. Optional if using an instance role. <code>GATEWAY_AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY</code> — AWS secret access key. Optional if using an instance role. <pre><code>GATEWAY_AWS_ENABLED=true
GATEWAY_AWS_REGION=us-east-1
GATEWAY_AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=&lt;key-id&gt;
GATEWAY_AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=&lt;secret-key&gt;
</code></pre>
